{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Hunters Guild!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not the hero slaying dragons, you just decide who's foolish enough to try! While the guild's reputation is in shambles, every hunt you approve could rebuild its glory... or bury it further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hunter's Seal</i></strong>\u00a0is a medieval fantasy job simulator where your observational skills and keen memory will be put to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Approve and Reject Hunts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120650/extras/2fc98c6f832de1b8133432b97d5cffcd.poster.avif?t=1762174883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120650/extras/2fc98c6f832de1b8133432b97d5cffcd.webm?t=1762174883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120650/extras/2fc98c6f832de1b8133432b97d5cffcd.mp4?t=1762174883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to identify the monster being described in a request and determine if a hunter is capable of slaying it based on their skill, weapon, and personality. Every quest demands something different, and the things to look out for grows everyday.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not So Unique Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identifying monsters won't be easy. Even though every creature is unique, many share similar traits that could be confused for one another.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunters of All Shapes and Sizes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120650/extras/0eb58af5e55fef47910895802cbc3ead.poster.avif?t=1762174883\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120650/extras/0eb58af5e55fef47910895802cbc3ead.webm?t=1762174883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120650/extras/0eb58af5e55fef47910895802cbc3ead.mp4?t=1762174883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hunters are just as varied with their own ranks, weapons, and talents. Each hunter needs to be evaluated to make sure they're well suited for hunting monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo includes the following gameplay content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identifying monsters based on descriptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verifying hunter information.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approving or rejecting hunt requests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your finances.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120650?t=1762174883","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120650?t=1762174883","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120650/1ab7b1939016eedaa9e39a5ea3fe39af0ebb68ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762174883","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120650/1ab7b1939016eedaa9e39a5ea3fe39af0ebb68ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762174883","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welco